Subject: [PATCH 02/22] arm64: dts: renesas: r8a7796: Add FDP1 instance
Date: Fri, 29 Sep 2017 13:52:11 +0200
Message-Id: <8ef7512a68f4cd559af5d5f0be3ee2e89f0769ec.1506678250.git.horms+renesas@verge.net.au>
